============================================================
OVERVIEW
============================================================

ForgeUI is a modular ESP32-P4 embedded application framework,
hardware baseline, and LVGL user interface architecture
developed for real embedded products using:

- ESP-IDF
- LVGL
- ESP-Hosted WiFi
- Waveshare ESP32-P4 board support ecosystems
- related Espressif managed components

ForgeUI provides:

- reusable embedded UI architecture
- hardware-proven ESP32-P4 bring-up
- modular runtime systems
- reusable LVGL patterns
- product-oriented embedded structure
- ESP32-P4 application foundations

ForgeUI is intended as a clean embedded product baseline,
not a demo-only environment.


============================================================
PERMITTED USE
============================================================

You may:

- Use ForgeUI for personal projects
- Use ForgeUI for educational purposes
- Use ForgeUI for learning and evaluation
- Use ForgeUI for internal commercial development
- Modify ForgeUI-owned source files
- Build commercial products using ForgeUI
- Distribute compiled firmware binaries built using ForgeUI
- Use ForgeUI as part of a larger embedded product


